.com&oh=00_Af3ywKr41qqW1tZj7IhraHqa-FDR_qN7Ns0OcMp5oJjbsQ&oe=69F20D83"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gumi no Yume - Premium", "keywords": ["puzzle", "classic", "Sokoban", "gummy", "candy"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in Gumi no Yume, a virtual dreamworld where you can help Kon-kon and his friends navigate through puzzles full of fluffy marshmallows, jiggly gummies, and much more. It\u2019s a super kawaii candy adventure that brings a new twist to an old puzzle classic.\n\nUse your puzzle-solving power to bump colorful gummies around the game board and win your way through a 3D world inspired by the popular classic, Sokoban. Can you solve the puzzle before you run out of moves? Will Kon-kon ever get to eat all of the yummy candy he collects? The world may never know\u2026but you will if you play Gumi no Yumi!\n\nPremium Features:\n-All Stages and Levels are UNLOCKED!\n-All Future Content Packs are INCLUDED!\n\nFeatures:\n-A colorful VR adventure sure to please anyone\u2019s sweet tooth\n-Adorable music you can\u2019t help but dance to\n-Easy to learn, fun to play, a challenge to master\n\n(Kon-kon\u2014Nickname for Konpeito, also\u2026What the fox says in Japanese!!)", "short_description": "Premium Features:\n-All Stages and Levels are UNLOCKED!\n-All Future Content Packs are INCLUDED!\n\nImmerse yourself in Gumi no Yume, a virtual dreamworld where you can help Kon-kon and his friends navigate through puzzles full of fluffy marshmallows, jiggly gummies, and much more. It\u2019s a super kawaii candy adventure that brings a new twist to an old puzzle classic."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/7759324", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.lucidsight.com/tos.html", "publisher_name": "Lucid Sight, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.lucidsight.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "